* Personal Endings

**** Some obsolete stuff
1. keep verbs like they are
2. change one of the endings in nouns to -i

verbal subject markers, singular and plural 
|--------|--------------|
| -em    | 1s           |
| -emen  | 1p           |
| -eps   | 2s           |
| -epsen | 2p           |
| -eth   | 3s Sapient   |
| -ethen | 3p Sapient   |
| -os    | 3s Insapient |
| -osen  | 3p Insapient |
|--------|--------------|

