| en.emen  | plural nominal    1st person plural possesor              |
| eps      | singular nominal  2nd person singular possessor           |
| en.eps   | plural nominal    2nd person singular possessor           |
| epsen    | singular nominal  2nd person plural possessor             |
| en.epsen | plural nominal    2nd person plural possessor             |
| eth      | singular nominal  3rd person Sapient singular possessor   |
| en.eth   | plural nominal    3rd person Sapient singular possessor   |
| ethen    | singular nominal  3rd person Sapient plural possessor     |
| en.ethen | plural nominal    3rd person Sapient plural possessor     |
| os       | singular nominal  3rd person Insapient singular possessor |
| en.os    | plural nominal    3rd person Insapient singular possessor |
| osen     | singular nominal  3rd person Insapient plural possessor   |
| en.osen  | plural nominal    3rd person Insapient plural possessor   |
|----------+-----------------------------------------------------------|





